@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
title School Facility Rental - Sequence
actor Renter
participant Website
participant "School Staff" as Staff
participant "Payment Service" as Pay
participant "Email Service" as Email
Renter -> Website: submit request
Website -> Website: check availability
Website -> Staff: send request for review
alt approved
Staff --> Website: approved
Website --> Pay: processing payment
alt payment success
Pay --> Website: payment succeeds
Website --> Website: save booking
Website --> Email: sending confirmation
Email --> Renter: sending confirmation email
else payment failure
Pay --> Website: payment failure
Website --> Website: record payment failure
Website --> Email: sending failure
Email --> Renter: sending payment failure email
end
else rejected
Staff --> Website: rejected
Website --> Website: record rejection
Website --> Email: sending rejection
Email --> Renter: email renter about rejection
end
@enduml